[2026-09-26 00:15:25] [DEBUG   ] discord.gateway: For Shard ID None: WebSocket Event: {'t': 'MESSAGE_CREATE', 's': 7, 'op': 0, 'd': {'webhook_id': '1534751510737453186', 'type': 20, 'tts': False, 'timestamp': '2026-09-26T07:15:25.916000+00:00', 'pinned': False, 'nonce': '1553303969265090560', 'mentions': [], 'mention_roles': [], 'mention_everyone': False, 'interaction_metadata': {'user': {'vad_colors': None, 'username': 'megajoltz', 'public_flags': 0, 'primary_guild': None, 'id': '385277889404207105', 'global_name': 'MegaJoltz', 'display_name_styles': None, 'discriminator': '0', 'collectibles': None, 'clan': None, 'avatar_decoration_data': None, 'avatar': 'fb8b1cae3be44ba623caee0610343864'}, 'type': 2, 'name': 'help', 'id': '1553303970531901471', 'command_type': 1, 'authorizing_integration_owners': {'0': '1534754711536799864'}}, 'interaction': {'user': {'vad_colors': None, 'username': 'megajoltz', 'public_flags': 0, 'primary_guild': None, 'id': '385277889404207105', 'global_name': 'MegaJoltz', 'display_name_styles': None, 'discriminator': '0', 'collectibles': None, 'clan': None, 'avatar_decoration_data': None, 'avatar': 'fb8b1cae3be44ba623caee0610343864'}, 'type': 2, 'name': 'help', 'id': '1553303970531901471'}, 'id': '1553303971995590726', 'flags': 64, 'embeds': [], 'edited_timestamp': None, 'content': "```text\n📖 Lysithea Help\n\nHere are some of the things I can do!\n\n👤 PROFILE & ACCOUNT\n\n/guildcard (Any Guild Member)\nView your profile, level, XP, and games.\n\n/link_steam (Steam ID)\nLink your Steam account so I can keep track of your games. Linking your account is 100% safe, I won't even be able to tell if you actually own the account or not.\nhow it works:\nEveryone has a public Steam ID that you can see if you go to anyone's profile and look at the url. \nFor example if you open steam and go to your profile or any other profile you would see something like https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/**xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx**/\nthe (xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx) is that accounts Steam ID. All you need to do is use /link_steam (xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx) and hit confirm if that is the profile you want to sync.\n\n** IF YOU ARE NOT FRIENDS WITH MY BOSS ON STEAM YOUR PROFILE WILL HAVE TO BE SET TO PUBLIC **\n- This is because basically what I'm doing is looking up your profile on steam and then looking at your games 1 by 1 just like any normal steam user can.\nI do these searches with my Boss' account so that's why if your friends with him I can also see your account.\n\n**What about the games I would rather people not see...**\nDON'T WORRY \n- I cannot see any games that are marked private in your library. I cannot see anything that my Boss couldn't see if he checked your profile.\nAlso I only check your profile once a day at 12:00 AM. \n\n/unlink_steam\nUnlink your Steam account and remove your Steam account information. \nAny games that I've seen you play online will still be recorded so you won't loose any data\n```", 'components': [], 'channel_type': 0, 'channel_id': '1534754712669126738', 'author': {'vad_colors': None, 'username': 'Proto', 'public_flags': 0, 'primary_guild': None, 'id': '1534751510737453186', 'global_name': None, 'display_name_styles': None, 'discriminator': '2867', 'collectibles': None, 'clan': None, 'bot': True, 'avatar_decoration_data': None, 'avatar': None}, 'attachments': [], 'application_id': '1534751510737453186'}}
