 under their name that is what I look for.\nIf you link your steam though I will still be able to record your playtime if you're account is not set to private or if you are friends with my Boss on Steam\n\n\n🏆 WEEKLY STATS & MVP\n\nWeekly statistics keep track of things such as:\n\n• Games played\n• Game time\n• Voice activity\n• Streaming\n• Messages\n\nEach week, an MVP is selected based on their activity.\n\nPoints are awarded as follows:\n6 points / 1 hour of streaming\n\n3 points / 1 hour in calls\n\n2 points / 1 hour of gaming \n\n(xp follows a similar point system)\n\n📰 GAME NEWS\n\nI'll periodically check the games being played by members of the\nserver and look for relevant game news.\n\nDon't worry, I won't flood the server with every article I find.\nI'll make sure previously posted articles aren't repeated.\n\n\n🎉 HOLIDAYS\n\nI'll occasionally send announcements for holidays and other\nspecial occasions.\n\nNaturally, I'll make sure they're handled properly.\n\n\n❓ STILL NEED HELP?\n\nIf you're having trouble with something or think you've found a bug,\nask my boss directly. I'm sure they'll be happy to help.\n```", 'components': [], 'channel_type': 0, 'channel_id': '1534754712669126738', 'author': {'vad_colors': None, 'username': 'Proto', 'public_flags': 0, 'primary_guild': None, 'id': '1534751510737453186', 'global_name': None, 'display_name_styles': None, 'discriminator': '2867', 'collectibles': None, 'clan': None, 'bot': True, 'avatar_decoration_data': None, 'avatar': None}, 'attachments': [], 'application_id': '1534751510737453186'}}
